WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.272
Step one: prepare. Read the
machine's lockout placard so you know

2
00:00:04.272 --> 00:00:07.756
every energy source and
where its isolation point is.

3
00:00:07.756 --> 00:00:11.174
Step two: notify the affected
employees that you are

4
00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:14.132
shutting the machine
down and locking it out.

5
00:00:14.132 --> 00:00:18.339
Step three: shut the machine down
using its normal stop control,

6
00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:22.282
never by pulling a disconnect
while it's running under load.
